# The repository stores text with LF and Prettier is configured for LF, so the
# working tree has to use LF as well. Without this a checkout on Windows, where
# core.autocrlf defaults to true, turns every file into a lint error.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.tar.gz binary
